<template>
 <view class="oral-setup glass">
  <view class="setup-heading"><view><text class="setup-eyebrow">PARLONS FRANÇAIS</text><h2>准备好，开口说法语</h2><text class="setup-subtitle">完成一次设置，以后直接开始你的 DELF A1 口语练习。</text></view><button v-if="closable" class="icon-button" @click="$emit('close')" aria-label="关闭配置"><Icon name="close"/></button></view>
  <view class="setup-steps" role="tablist" aria-label="口语配置步骤"><button v-for="(title,index) in stages" :key="title" role="tab" :aria-selected="step===index" :class="['setup-step',{active:step===index}]" @click="step=index"><text class="step-number">{{ index+1 }}</text><text>{{ title }}</text></button></view>
  <view v-if="error" class="setup-error" role="alert">{{ error }}</view>
  <view v-if="step===0" class="setup-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-label="本地法语识别">
   <view class="panel-heading"><view class="soft-icon"><Icon name="microphone"/></view><view><h3>导入法语识别模型</h3><text class="setup-subtitle">从下载页单独取得模型文件，导入一次即可在本机识别。 / Importez le modèle pour la reconnaissance locale.</text></view></view>
   <view class="model-card"><view class="model-topline"><text>Whisper Large V3 French</text><text :class="['state-tag',{success:status.model?.ready}]">{{ status.model?.ready?'模型已就绪 · Prêt':modelBusy?'正在处理 · En cours':'待导入 · À importer' }}</text></view><text class="model-detail">法语专用模型 · Q5 · {{ size(status.model?.total||1081140203) }}</text><text class="status-line" aria-live="polite">{{ modelLabel }}</text><view class="setup-actions"><button class="button primary" :disabled="modelBusy" @click="act('model.import')"><Icon name="upload"/>导入本地模型 · Importer</button><button class="button secondary" @click="openDownloads">模型下载页 · Télécharger<Icon name="arrow"/></button><button v-if="status.model?.ready||status.model?.storedBytes" class="inline-action" :disabled="modelBusy" @click="confirmDelete='model'">删除模型 · Supprimer</button></view></view>
   <view v-if="status.recognizer?.state==='preparing'" class="setup-note" aria-live="polite"><span class="spinner"/>首次准备语音引擎 · 已等待 {{ preparationSeconds }} 秒。显卡首次准备可能约一分钟，你可以先继续配置小智。</view>
   <view v-if="status.recognizer?.ready" class="setup-note success-note"><Icon name="check"/>识别引擎已就绪 · {{ status.recognizer.backend==='gpu'?'显卡加速':'CPU 兼容模式' }}</view>
   <view v-if="status.model?.error||status.recognizer?.state==='failed'" class="setup-error" role="alert">{{ status.model?.error||status.recognizer.message }}</view>
   <button v-if="status.recognizer?.state==='failed'" class="button secondary" :disabled="busy" @click="act('recognizer.prepare')">重新检查并准备语音引擎</button>
   <details class="setup-details"><summary>模型文件要求 · Fichier requis</summary><text>请选择下载页中的 ggml-model-q5_0.bin，约 1.08 GB。导入时会校验完整文件，其他同名或格式不符的文件不能使用。 / Choisissez le fichier Q5 de 1,08 Go ; son intégrité sera vérifiée.</text></details>
   <view class="setup-footer"><text>录音在本机转成法语文字；联网考官负责对话。</text><button class="button primary" @click="step=1">下一步：配置考官<Icon name="arrow"/></button></view>
  </view>
  <view v-if="step===1" class="setup-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-label="配置小智考官">
   <view class="panel-heading"><view class="soft-icon"><Icon name="link"/></view><view><h3>创建你的法语口语考官</h3><text class="setup-subtitle">只需自己的小智账号，无需购买硬件。按下面的顺序操作即可。</text></view></view>
   <view class="guide-block"><text class="guide-index">01</text><view><h4>注册或登录小智</h4><p>点击下方按钮打开小智网站，按网站当前提供的方式注册或登录。登录后进入「智能体」控制台；如果首页仍是介绍页，先点页面里的控制台入口。</p><button class="button secondary" @click="openConsole">打开小智 · 注册 / 登录<Icon name="arrow"/></button></view></view>
   <view class="guide-block"><text class="guide-index">02</text><view><h4>新建「DELF A1 法语口语考官」</h4><p>在「智能体」页面，点「添加设备」右侧的小箭头，再点「新建智能体」。名称填写 <strong>DELF A1 法语口语考官</strong>，然后打开该智能体的配置。</p><view class="config-table"><view><strong>角色</strong><text>语言选「法语」，音色选能正常朗读法语的声音。打开「自定义」，将下方完整提示词粘贴进角色介绍，替换默认的人设。</text></view><view><strong>模型与记忆</strong><text>选择账号可用的语言模型。只有「小智 Lite」可用时也可以先测试；其他模型如需 GitHub 认证，按小智页面完成授权。建议关闭「记忆」，避免混入上一次练习内容。</text></view><view><strong>声纹识别 / 扩展能力</strong><text>首次使用保持默认，无需声纹、知识库或额外 MCP 接入点。完成后点击「保存」。</text></view></view><button class="button primary copy-prompt" @click="copy(examinerConfig)"><Icon name="copy"/>复制完整考官提示词</button><details class="setup-details"><summary>查看全部提示词（已包含三个环节和 AI 点评）</summary><pre class="prompt-preview">{{ examinerConfig }}</pre></details><p class="fine-print">小智界面的名称和模型权限可能调整，以你账号实际显示为准。不要把绑定码填进提示词。</p></view></view>
   <view class="guide-block"><text class="guide-index">03</text><view><h4>把这台电脑绑定到考官</h4><p>点击「获取本机绑定码」。回到小智控制台，点「添加设备」，输入这里显示的绑定码，并选择刚创建的「DELF A1 法语口语考官」。然后回到本页等待连接；过期后可重新获取。</p><view v-if="status.provider?.status==='waiting'" class="binding-card"><strong>{{ status.provider.code }}</strong><text>剩余 {{ remaining }}</text><button class="inline-action" @click="copy(status.provider.code)"><Icon name="copy"/>复制绑定码</button></view><view class="setup-actions"><button class="button primary" :disabled="bindingBusy||['fetching','connecting'].includes(status.provider?.status)" @click="beginBinding">{{ bindingAction }}</button><button class="button secondary" @click="openConsole">打开小智控制台</button></view><p :class="['connection-line',{connected}]" aria-live="polite">{{ connected?'考官已连接，可以继续下一步。':bindingLabel }}</p><text v-if="bindingError" class="setup-error" role="alert">{{ bindingError }}</text></view></view>
   <view class="setup-footer"><button class="inline-action" @click="step=0">上一步</button><button class="button primary" @click="step=2">下一步：检查并开始<Icon name="arrow"/></button></view>
  </view>
  <view v-if="step===2" class="setup-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-label="检查并开始">
   <view class="panel-heading"><view class="soft-icon"><Icon name="check"/></view><view><h3>最后检查，就可以开始了</h3><text class="setup-subtitle">每次先听考官说完，再开始录音。建议在安静的地方练习。</text></view></view>
   <view class="check-list"><view><Icon :name="status.model?.ready&&status.recognizer?.ready!==false?'check':'microphone'"/><view><strong>本地法语识别</strong><text>{{ status.model?.ready?(status.recognizer?.state==='failed'?status.recognizer.message:status.recognizer?.ready===false?'语音引擎仍在准备，请稍候':'模型与引擎已就绪'):modelLabel }}</text></view><button class="inline-action" @click="step=0">查看</button></view><view><Icon name="link"/><view><strong>小智法语考官</strong><text>{{ connected?'已连接':bindingLabel }}</text></view><button class="inline-action" @click="step=1">{{ connected?'查看':'去配置' }}</button></view><view><Icon name="microphone"/><view><strong>麦克风</strong><text>{{ microphone?'已允许使用':'点击授权，并在浏览器弹窗中选择允许' }}</text></view><button class="button secondary" :disabled="micBusy" @click="allowMicrophone">{{ microphone?'已允许':micBusy?'正在授权…':'允许麦克风' }}</button></view></view>
   <text v-if="microphoneError" class="setup-error" role="alert">{{ microphoneError }}</text><view v-if="ready" class="ready-message"><Icon name="check"/><text>一切就绪，开始你的第一轮法语对话吧。</text></view><text v-else class="setup-subtitle" aria-live="polite">{{ nextStep }}</text>
   <view class="setup-footer"><button class="inline-action" @click="step=1">上一步</button><button class="button primary" :disabled="!ready" @click="enter">进入口语练习<Icon name="arrow"/></button></view>
   <details class="setup-details"><summary>连接管理与数据说明</summary><text>语音识别在本机运行，识别后的文字发送到你的小智考官。联网服务权限与费用以平台规则为准。电脑与手机需要分别绑定。</text><view class="setup-actions"><button class="inline-action" @click="changeAgent">更换考官智能体</button><button class="inline-action" @click="confirmDelete='binding'">清除本机连接信息</button></view><text v-if="agentHelp">请在小智控制台调整设备所属智能体，再回来重新连接。本机清除不会删除口语历史；解除账号绑定请在小智控制台操作。</text></details>
  </view>
  <view v-if="confirmDelete" class="setup-delete-shade"><view class="glass setup-delete-dialog"><h3>{{ confirmDelete==='model'?'删除本机识别模型？ / Supprimer le modèle ?':'清除本机连接信息？' }}</h3><p>{{ confirmDelete==='model'?'学习记录、口语历史和绑定会保留。 / Vos données et votre connexion seront conservées.':'学习记录和口语历史会保留。' }}</p><view class="setup-actions"><button class="button secondary" @click="confirmDelete=''">取消</button><button class="button primary" :disabled="busy" @click="remove">确认清除</button></view></view></view>
 </view>
</template>
<script setup>
import {computed,ref,onMounted,onUnmounted} from 'vue';import Bi from './Bi.vue';import Icon from './Icon.vue';import {oralCall} from '../oral/native-bridge.js';import {nativeHost} from '../platform/native.js';import examinerConfig from '../oral/examiner-config.js';
const props=defineProps({closable:Boolean,autoEnter:Boolean});const emit=defineEmits(['close','ready','status','notice']);const step=ref(0),status=ref({}),error=ref(''),busy=ref(false),micBusy=ref(false),microphoneError=ref(''),bindingBusy=ref(false),bindingError=ref(''),microphone=ref(false),help=ref(false),agentHelp=ref(false),confirmDelete=ref(''),tick=ref(Date.now());let timer,alive=true,refreshing=false,browserPermission;
const connected=computed(()=>status.value.provider?.status==='connected'),ready=computed(()=>status.value.model?.ready&&status.value.recognizer?.ready!==false&&microphone.value&&connected.value),percent=computed(()=>Math.min(100,Math.floor((status.value.model?.downloaded||0)/(status.value.model?.total||1)*100))),remaining=computed(()=>{const n=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(((status.value.provider?.expires||0)-tick.value)/1000));return `${Math.floor(n/60)}:${String(n%60).padStart(2,'0')}`;});
const modelLabel=computed(()=>({checking:'正在检查模型 / Vérification…',missing:'请导入本地模型 / Importez le modèle',paused:'下载已暂停 / En pause',connecting:'正在连接下载源 / Connexion à la source…',downloading:'正在下载 / Téléchargement…',verifying:'正在校验 / Vérification…',ready:'模型已就绪 · 本机识别 / Modèle prêt',failed:'模型未就绪，请重新导入 / Réimportez le modèle',invalid:'校验未通过 / Modèle invalide',installing:'正在校验并连接随附模型 / Installation…',importing:'正在导入并校验 / Importation…'})[status.value.model?.state]||'正在读取 / Chargement…');
const bindingLabel=computed(()=>status.value.provider?.message||'绑定自己的小智账号 / Liez votre compte.');
const bindingAction=computed(()=>bindingBusy.value||status.value.provider?.status==='fetching'?'正在获取绑定信息':status.value.provider?.status==='connecting'?'正在连接考官':connected.value||status.value.provider?.bound?'重新连接考官':status.value.provider?.status==='waiting'?'刷新绑定状态':'获取本机绑定码');
const nextStep=computed(()=>!status.value.model?.ready?'请先导入本地模型 / Importez le modèle.':status.value.recognizer?.ready===false?'语音引擎正在准备，请稍候 / Préparation du moteur…':!microphone.value?'请允许麦克风 / Autorisez le microphone.':status.value.provider?.status==='connecting'?'正在连接考官，完成后自动进入 / Connexion à l’examinateur…':!connected.value?(status.value.provider?.bound?'请查看上方提示并重连考官 / Vérifiez le message et reconnectez.':'请完成小智绑定并等待连接 / Liez votre examinateur.'):'准备完成 / Prêt.');

function size(n=0){return n>=1e9?(n/1e9).toFixed(2)+' GB':(n/1e6).toFixed(1)+' MB';}
function microphoneHost(){const host=nativeHost();return typeof host?.microphonePermission==='function'&&typeof host?.requestMicrophonePermission==='function'?host:null;}
function setMicrophonePermission(permission,notify=false){if(!alive)return;if(permission==='requesting'){micBusy.value=true;return;}if(!['granted','denied','prompt'].includes(permission))return;const wasBusy=micBusy.value,wasGranted=microphone.value;microphone.value=permission==='granted';micBusy.value=false;if(microphone.value){microphoneError.value='';if(wasBusy||notify&&!wasGranted)emit('notice','麦克风已允许 / Microphone autorisé.');}else if(notify&&wasBusy){microphoneError.value='请在系统应用权限中允许麦克风 / Autorisez le microphone dans les paramètres.';emit('notice',microphoneError.value);}}
async function syncMicrophonePermission(){try{const host=microphoneHost();if(host){setMicrophonePermission(host.microphonePermission());return;}if(!browserPermission){browserPermission=await navigator.permissions.query({name:'microphone'});browserPermission.onchange=()=>setMicrophonePermission(browserPermission.state);}setMicrophonePermission(browserPermission.state);}catch{}}
function microphonePermissionEvent(event){if(microphoneHost())setMicrophonePermission(event.detail?.permission,true);}
async function refresh(){if(refreshing)return;refreshing=true;try{await syncMicrophonePermission();const value=await oralCall('status');if(!alive)return;status.value=value;error.value='';emit('status',{...value,microphone:microphone.value});}catch(e){if(alive)error.value=e.message;}finally{refreshing=false;}}
async function act(method,args={}){if(busy.value)return;busy.value=true;error.value='';try{const result=await oralCall(method,args);if(method.startsWith('model.')&&result?.state)status.value={...status.value,model:result};await refresh();return true;}catch(e){error.value=e.message;emit('notice',e.message);return false;}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function beginBinding(){if(bindingBusy.value)return;bindingBusy.value=true;bindingError.value='';emit('notice','正在获取绑定信息 / Activation…');try{const provider=await oralCall('binding.begin');status.value={...status.value,provider};await refresh();}catch(e){bindingError.value=e.message;emit('notice',e.message);}finally{bindingBusy.value=false;}}
async function allowMicrophone(){if(micBusy.value)return;await syncMicrophonePermission();if(microphone.value){emit('notice','麦克风已允许 / Microphone autorisé.');return;}micBusy.value=true;microphoneError.value='';try{const host=microphoneHost();if(host){host.requestMicrophonePermission();return;}const stream=await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({audio:true});stream.getTracks().forEach(t=>t.stop());if(!alive)return;microphone.value=true;micBusy.value=false;emit('notice','麦克风已允许 / Microphone autorisé.');await refresh();}catch(e){micBusy.value=false;microphoneError.value=e.name==='NotFoundError'?'没有找到可用麦克风 / Aucun microphone disponible.':e.name==='NotReadableError'?'麦克风暂时无法使用，请检查系统麦克风开关或其他录音应用 / Microphone indisponible.':'请允许麦克风权限后重试 / Autorisez le microphone.';emit('notice',microphoneError.value);}}
async function copy(text){try{if(navigator.clipboard?.writeText)await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);else{const input=document.createElement('textarea');input.value=text;document.body.append(input);input.select();if(!document.execCommand('copy'))throw Error();input.remove();}error.value='';emit('notice','已复制 / Copié.');}catch{error.value='复制失败，请重试 / Copie impossible.';}}
function openConsole(){const host=nativeHost();if(host)host.openExternalLink('https://xiaozhi.me/');else window.open('https://xiaozhi.me/','_blank','noopener,noreferrer');}
function openDownloads(){const url='https://github.com/zyh307/qihang-french/releases/tag/v2.3.5',host=nativeHost();if(host)host.openExternalLink(url);else window.open(url,'_blank','noopener,noreferrer');}
function changeAgent(){agentHelp.value=true;openConsole();}
async function remove(){await act(confirmDelete.value==='model'?'model.delete':'binding.clear',{confirmed:true});confirmDelete.value='';}
function resume(){if(document.visibilityState==='visible'){oralCall('resume').catch(()=>{});refresh();}}
onMounted(async()=>{document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',resume);window.addEventListener('qihang-resume',resume);window.addEventListener('qihang-microphone-permission',microphonePermissionEvent);await refresh();if(alive)timer=setInterval(()=>{tick.value=Date.now();refresh();},1000);});onUnmounted(()=>{alive=false;clearInterval(timer);if(browserPermission)browserPermission.onchange=null;document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange',resume);window.removeEventListener('qihang-resume',resume);window.removeEventListener('qihang-microphone-permission',microphonePermissionEvent);});

const stages=['本地法语识别','配置小智考官','检查并开始'];
const preparationSeconds=computed(()=>Math.ceil((status.value.recognizer?.elapsedMs||0)/1000));
const modelBusy=computed(()=>busy.value||['checking','installing','importing','verifying','downloading','connecting'].includes(status.value.model?.state));
function enter(){if(ready.value)emit('ready');}
</script>
<style scoped>
.oral-setup{width:100%;max-width:940px;margin:0 auto;padding:34px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:25px;color:var(--ink);box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:var(--glass)}
.setup-heading{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.setup-eyebrow{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:11px}.setup-heading h2{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.5px;font-weight:600}.setup-subtitle{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#78849a;line-height:1.9;margin-top:9px}.setup-heading .icon-button{flex:none}.setup-steps{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:23px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:26px}.setup-step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;flex:1;min-width:0;padding:12px 10px;border-radius:13px;color:#8290a8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;border:1px solid transparent}.setup-step.active{background:#e8ecf9;color:var(--accent-dark);border-color:#d7dff1}.step-number{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff9;font-size:12px;flex:none}.setup-step.active .step-number{background:var(--accent);color:white}.panel-heading{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:23px}.panel-heading .soft-icon{width:43px;height:43px;flex:none;border-radius:14px;background:#e8ecf7;color:var(--accent);display:grid;place-items:center}.soft-icon .icon{width:21px;height:21px}.setup-panel h3{margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.65}.model-card{padding:22px;background:#ffffff85;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px}.model-topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:550;flex-wrap:wrap}.state-tag{font-size:11px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#edf0f8;color:#7b88a5;font-weight:400}.state-tag.success{background:#e6f0ea;color:#4e7863}.model-detail{display:block;color:#8b94a7;font-size:11px;margin:9px 0 18px}.status-line{font-size:12px;color:var(--accent-dark);display:block}.path-block{margin-top:17px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.path-block>text{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#8490a5;margin-bottom:7px}.path-block code{display:block;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:11px/1.8 Consolas,monospace;color:#64738c}.inline-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;color:var(--accent-dark);font-size:12px;min-height:36px;padding:6px 0;white-space:normal;line-height:1.6}.inline-action .icon{width:14px;height:14px}.setup-note{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-top:18px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:13px;background:#eef0f8;color:#73809b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9}.success-note{background:#eaf2ed;color:#567565}.setup-note .icon{width:18px;flex:none}.setup-note .spinner{flex:none;width:17px;height:17px}.setup-details{margin-top:21px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#77849a}.setup-details summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent-dark);padding:7px 0}.setup-details>text{display:block;margin:10px 0}.setup-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px}.oral-setup .button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;border-radius:13px;min-height:43px;height:auto;padding:11px 17px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;white-space:normal;min-width:0}.oral-setup .button .icon{width:16px;height:16px;flex:none}.oral-setup .button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:1px solid transparent}.oral-setup .button.secondary{background:#ffffff90;border:1px solid #d9dfed;color:var(--accent-dark)}.setup-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-top:28px;padding-top:23px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.setup-footer>text{font-size:11px;color:#8a95a9;line-height:1.9;max-width:320px}.guide-block{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px;padding:23px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.guide-block:last-of-type{border-bottom:0}.guide-index{font:italic 23px Georgia;color:#a3b0cc;flex:none;width:31px}.guide-block>view{flex:1;min-width:0}.guide-block h4{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:550;margin:0 0 10px}.guide-block p,.setup-